anchor_english:
“Nor you to mine,” cried the abbé. “You will not accept my gold; I will keep it
for myself. You refuse me my liberty; God will give it me.” And the abbé,
casting away his coverlet, resumed his place, and continued his calculations.

“Yes; I hope so, at least. Now go.” He made a sign to Cocles, who went first;
the seamen followed him and Emmanuel brought up the rear. “Now,” said the owner
to his wife and daughter, “leave me; I wish to speak with this gentleman.”

anchor_french:
« Oui ; je l'espère, du moins. Maintenant, partez. » Il fit signe à Cocles, qui partit le premier ;
les marins le suivirent et Emmanuel fermait la marche. « Maintenant, dit le propriétaire
à sa femme et à sa fille, laissez-moi seul ; je souhaite parler avec ce monsieur. »
